  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <p>\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4a6da24da655d1eb66acd6d16b881e87f2c31e76.png\" alt=\"武士王朝EC模組插件\" width=\"600\">\n    </p>\n   <p>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fec-es-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n         <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth平台可下載\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\">\n      </a> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n         <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a7bff26028f093d51d9da01e07e384f91f63ae13.png\" alt=\"需搭配Cloth Config API\" width=\"212\" height=\"56\">\n      </a> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n         <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5aec5c41ae6f0aac946a80fe3cf688a7a336fa09_0.webp\" alt=\"需搭配Curios API\" width=\"179\" height=\"56\">\n      </a> \n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n         <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/59e9eeade55f309be535f0b860f0219c8863d4b0_0.webp\" alt=\"需搭配Expanded Combat\" width=\"252\" height=\"56\">\n      </a> \n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n         <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fd696effc08fd790efe81cf4a2f8fbe99dca7e0b.png\" alt=\"需搭配武士王朝模組\" width=\"206\" height=\"56\">\n      </a>\n   </p>\n</div><p>此為<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">擴展戰鬥</a>模組的插件，新增與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩武士</a>的相容性。</p><h5><strong>重要事項：</strong></h5><p><strong>錯誤回報請使用GitHub問題追蹤系統<a href=\"https://github.com/userofbricks/Expanded-Combat/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</strong></p><p><strong>其他討論需求請至Discord<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7cR4Vwv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>新增材質支援：</h4><p>鋼鐵材質 - 盾牌、箭矢、弓、弩、武器、箭袋與護手</p><p>忍者護甲 - 全五種類型及標準布質護手</p><p>鍍層鋼材 - 紫水晶與石英護手</p><p>銀質護手<br>稻草護手</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>點擊橫幅獲取優惠：</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fuserofbricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d94f7046-2c94-404e-a3dc-3a798daef810.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
